| [since rank'(x)=rank(g)]
|-
|    || ≤ rank'(g) + rank'(x) − 2 rank(x)
| [since rank(x)<rank(p) and rank'(x)>rank'(p)]
|-
|    || ≤ 3(rank'(x)−rank(x)) − 2
| [due to the concavity of the log function]
